# Force LF regardless of platform for anything that gets executed inside a
# Linux container -- a CRLF-mangled entrypoint script fails with a cryptic
# "bad interpreter" error on the very first cold start, which is exactly
# the kind of self-inflicted problem this file exists to prevent.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.tf text eol=lf
*.tfvars text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
